{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"直化"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"直化"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>将范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维范畴","text":"纤维范畴"}},{"Plain":"对应到函子 $\\mathcal C \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$, 称为<strong>直化</strong> (straightening); 反之称为<strong>反直化</strong> (unstraightening).</p>\n"}]}}